2. **[P2] Correct the implementation report's preservation claim.** `task-2-report.md` states that the complete per-episode body remains unchanged and that the diff contains only the required insertions. A normal Git diff suppresses the line-ending difference, but the raw source comparison disproves byte preservation. Recheck raw bytes after correction and update the recorded final hash and preservation claim.

Spec compliance: FAIL

Task quality: FAIL

## Static review evidence

